1:{character:???}Wake up... Wake up... Wake up... Washizu…
2:{character:Iwao Washizu}Ouch... That hurts...
3:{character:???}Wake up, already, Washizu.
4:{character:Iwao Washizu}Who...? Who is that...?
5:{character:Iwao Washizu}Who the hell has the audacity?!!!!
6:The madman has awakened. Just as he's about to lose everything, the man known as the Lord of Mahjong Hell has returned to the final battlefield with his extreme obsession.
7:He has yet to fully awaken from his dream, and he can still see in his mind those two strange figures.
8:He can still vaguely remember that the two seemed to have claimed to be gods...
9:Kekeke... I guess your age is finally catching up with you. Washizu, no god will appear before you.
10:{character:Shigeru Akagi}The only god that will stand before you is the grim reaper.
11:{character:Iwao Washizu}Ka... Kakaka! You're not wrong, you know! The same goes for you, Akagi! Such a nonsensical dream could never actually happen. Tonight, the only thing that awaits us is the grim reaper!
12:???
13:Iwao Washizu
14:Shigeru Akagi
